       "STRADDLE WELLS - wells located OUTSIDE the reservation with one or more laterals penetrating the boundary - drilled BEFORE 2019-07-01. The share is not a flat percentage: it is 50 percent of certified straddle-well taxes multiplied by the on-reservation trust lands acreage ratio, plus 50 percent multiplied by the non-trust ratio, both certified annually by the Industrial Commission and published by the Tax Commissioner. Certified ratios: FY2025: trust 0.1570093, non-trust 0.2298095 (July 1, 2024 through June 30, 2025); FY2026: trust 0.1615461, non-trust 0.2294837 (July 1, 2025 through June 30, 2026).",
